<title>POLAND: Olawa plans new share issue.</title>
<headline>Olawa plans new share issue.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-10-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish non-ferrous metals smelter Olawa SA plans a new share issue ex-rights, the company said in a statement, giving no further details.</p>
<p>It said the issue has yet to be approved by a general shareholders' meeting due on November 8.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
